## Step 2: Generate the Animated Visual Forecast Map
Because your dataset is unstructured (h3_index), we will use our robust dateline-splitting routine and Matplotlib’s FuncAnimation engine to render each forecast step sequentially, saving the entire multi-day rollout as a unified .gif animation file.
